Cashier

Introduction
We are seeking a Cashier to join our team. The Cashier will provide friendly customer service, process transactions accurately, and support daily store operations.

About the Role
As a Cashier, you will operate a cash register (POS system), handle cash and other payment methods, assist customers with questions, maintain a clean and organized checkout area, and help with basic merchandise stocking.

Key Responsibilities
- Greet customers and respond to inquiries in a helpful and professional manner.
- Process sales transactions accurately using a POS system, including cash handling and card payments.
- Scan items, bag purchases, issue receipts, and manage refunds or exchanges according to policy.
- Balance cash drawer at the end of each shift and report discrepancies.
- Restock shelves and maintain product displays to support sales.
- Provide excellent customer service and resolve issues in a timely manner.
- Communicate effectively with team members and follow store policies.

Required Skills
- Cash Handling
- POS Systems Operation
- Shelf Restocking
- Customer Service
- Communication Skills

What We Offer
- Training and development opportunities
- Supportive team environment
- Flexible scheduling
- Opportunities for advancement

How to Apply
Please submit your resume and a brief note expressing your interest in the Cashier role.

